### Agro Backend - Subscriptions HTTP Requests
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 2. Create Subscription Plan
# @name createPlan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planName": "Kisan Mitra 2026",
  "description": "Annual farming support and advisory",
  "duration": 12,
  "durationUnit": "MONTH",
  "price": 1499.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "enabled": true,
  "region": "MAHARASHTRA"
}

### 3. List All Plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/plans

### 4. Create Subscription
# @name createSubscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscriberId": "farmer_001",
  "subscriberName": "Ramesh Patil",
  "subscriberType": "CUSTOMER",
  "planId": "REPLACE_WITH_PLAN_ID"
}

### 5. List All Subscriptions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions

### 6. Get Subscription by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/REPLACE_WITH_SUBSCRIPTION_ID

### 7. Cancel Subscription
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/REPLACE_WITH_SUBSCRIPTION_ID/cancel

### 8. Activate Subscription
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/REPLACE_WITH_SUBSCRIPTION_ID/activate

### 9. Get Subscriptions Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/dashboard
